      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "A LingBot World 2 timeline with camera moves. The rows under the beats are camera lanes: each block holds one move for as long as it lasts, then the lane goes back to idle. Moves on different lanes run together, so here the camera walks forward while it turns right, then strafes, then orbits. Click an empty spot on a lane to add a move; its edges snap to the model's chunks.\n\nThis model needs an image on the first beat, so Load Image feeds image_0. Set your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "A LingBot World 2 timeline with camera moves. The rows under the beats are camera lanes: each block holds one move for as long as it lasts, then the lane goes back to idle. Moves on different lanes run together, so here the camera walks forward while it turns right, then strafes, then orbits. Click an empty spot on a lane to add a move; its edges snap to the model's chunks.\n\nThis model needs an image on the first beat, so Load Image feeds image_0. Set your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      },
